#' S = State
#' A = All
#' @param p_feac Formal Enforcment Action Last Case Date Limiter Flag.  Enter a value of Y to additionally apply the p_feay year filter to the last formal enforcement action case date.  Use the p_fea parameter to control if the filter is within or outside the date span provided.
#' @param p_fea_5yr A Y value identifies facilities that have had a formal enforcement action within the last 5 years.
